{"id":"wb-7-1276","name":"南海神庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南海神庙","text":"南海神庙又称波罗庙，位于中国广东省广州市黄埔区穗东街道庙头社区旭日街22号，是古代皇帝祭祀海神洪圣的场所，也是海上丝绸之路的始发地。始建于隋朝开皇年间，至今已有1400多年历史，是中国四海神庙中唯一完整保存下来的建筑遗迹。2013年3月，南海神庙被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E7%A5%9E%E5%BA%99","revisionId":95221385,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95221385","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e7ef57dc4d5fa9a56c1628f0.jpg","title":"Guangzhou_Nanhaishen_Miao_2013.10.01_10-23-54.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Nanhaishen_Miao_2013.10.01_10-23-54.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/Guangzhou_Nanhaishen_Miao_2013.10.01_10-23-54.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"广州南海神庙\n\n头门","width":320,"height":213}}